hen a mesh or none mesh extender. What can reduce WiFi 🛜 range, water pipes, bricks, concrete, sheet metal, logs, marble etc. If your trying to get better range with top speeds from one room to another and there’s a bathroom in between, water pipes will reduce WiFi. So then try installing extender away from the bathroom. Test as you go. I don’t use speed test to check for best place, I use a WiFi value gauge meter. This never ends in explaining. Most important is you get the point in what I’m saying. Best of wishes to all. If any misspelled words, my apologies, I was texting fast.\n",
